content.text:
`PlanSeed` 这个名字我用得有点抽象。它的意思是：**给最终生成 brief 之前的一份“生成种子/草案输入”**。

它不是最终 `briefing.json`，也不是最终正文，而是 `BriefExplorerSkill` 探索完多源信息后，交给 `BriefGenerationSkill` 的结构化中间结果。

可以理解成：

```text
RankedSourceCandidate[] 
  ↓
BriefExplorerSkill
  ↓
BriefingPlanSeed
  ↓
BriefGenerationSkill
  ↓
briefing.txt + briefing.json
```

## 它里面应该有什么

例如：

```typescript
interface BriefingPlanSeed {
  themes: BriefTheme[];
  mustIncludeCandidateIds: string[];
  excludedCandidateIds: Array<{ id: string; reason: string }>;
  explorationReasoning: string[];
}
```

更具体一点：

```typescript
interface BriefTheme {
  id: string;
  title: string;
  category: "schedule_risk" | "urgent_action" | "launch_context" | "regulation" | "competitor_watch";
  candidateIds: string[];
  keyFacts: string[];
  recommendedAngle: string;
}
```

比如今天可能生成这样的 seed：

```json
{
  "themes": [
    {
      "title": "Schedule risks and prep",
      "category": "schedule_risk",
      "candidateIds": ["cal_006", "cal_007", "em_001", "em_002"],
      "keyFacts": [
        "Maya call overlaps the customer interview by fifteen minutes",
        "CEO asked Jordan to review board slides before the two o'clock prep",
        "Priya wants a recommendation on pulling GA forward two weeks"
      ],
      "recommendedAngle": "Lead with the overloaded afternoon and the decisions Jordan needs to prepare."
    },
    {
      "title": "PSD3 readiness",
      "category": "regulation",
      "candidateIds": ["cal_009", "em_011", "news_002"],
      "keyFacts": [
        "PSD3 final text dropped overnight",
        "The three o'clock compliance sync covers SCA thresholds and fraud-data sharing"
      ],
      "recommendedAngle": "Treat this as a must-read before the compliance sync."
    }
  ],
  "mustIncludeCandidateIds": ["cal_006", "cal_007", "em_009", "em_011", "news_001"],
  "excludedCandidateIds": [
    { "id": "news_006", "reason": "sports, excluded by user preference" }
  ],
  "explorationReasoning": [
    "PSD3 appears across calendar, email, and news, so it should be merged into one theme.",
    "Calendar conflict is a high-priority schedule risk."
  ]
}
```

## 为什么需要它

因为它把“探索”和“写作”分开：

- `BriefExplorerSkill` 负责：今天有哪些主题？哪些必须包含？哪些跨源信息要合并？
- `BriefGenerationSkill` 负责：怎么把这些主题写成 60–90 秒的英文 TTS 简报？

这样写作 Agent 不需要重新探索所有输入，也不会随意丢掉高分信息。

## 要不要改名

我觉得可以改名，因为 `PlanSeed` 确实不够直观。更好的名字：

- `BriefingOutline`
- `BriefingAgenda`
- `BriefingBlueprint`
- `BriefingPlanDraft`

我建议用 **`BriefingOutline`**。它更像“生成前的大纲”：包含主题、候选 ids、关键事实、推荐角度和必须包含项。比 `PlanSeed` 好懂。

